{"ref":"BDB, מִסְפֵּד²","hw":"מִסְפֵּד²","html":"<big><span dir=\"rtl\">מִסְפֵּד</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 50:10\" href=\"/Genesis.50.10\">Gn 50:10</a> <strong>wailing</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Amos 5:16\" href=\"/Amos.5.16\">Am 5:16</a> + 11 times; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִסְפַּד</span> <a data-ref=\"Micah 1:11\" href=\"/Micah.1.11\">Mi 1:11</a> + 2 times; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִסְפְּדִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 30:12\" href=\"/Psalms.30.12\">ψ 30:12</a>;—<em>wailing:</em><br><strong>1.</strong>  for dead, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 50:10\" href=\"/Genesis.50.10\">Gn 50:10</a> (J; as acc. cogn.), <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 12:10\" href=\"/Zechariah.12.10\">Zc 12:10</a> (c. <span dir=\"rtl\">עַל־</span> cf. v <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 12:11\" href=\"/Zechariah.12.11\">11</a><sup>(×2)</sup> infr.).<br><strong>2.</strong>  for calamity experienced <a data-ref=\"Amos 5:16\" href=\"/Amos.5.16\">Am 5:16</a><sup>(×2)</sup> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵבֶל</span>), v <a data-ref=\"Amos 5:17\" href=\"/Amos.5.17\">17</a> <a data-ref=\"Micah 1:8\" href=\"/Micah.1.8\">Mi 1:8</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳ כַּתַּנִּים</span>, ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵבֶל</span>), v <a data-ref=\"Micah 1:11\" href=\"/Micah.1.11\">11</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:38\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.38\">Je 48:38</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 27:31\" href=\"/Ezekiel.27.31\">Ez 27:31</a>, anticipated <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 6:26\" href=\"/Jeremiah.6.26\">Je 6:26</a> <a data-ref=\"Esther 4:3\" href=\"/Esther.4.3\">Est 4:3</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  in contrition <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 22:12\" href=\"/Isaiah.22.12\">Is 22:12</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּכִי</span>), <a data-ref=\"Joel 2:12\" href=\"/Joel.2.12\">Jo 2:12</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">צוֹם</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּכִי</span>), cf. <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 12:11\" href=\"/Zechariah.12.11\">Zc 12:11</a><sup>(×2)</sup>.<br><strong>4.</strong>  in gen., <a data-ref=\"Psalms 30:12\" href=\"/Psalms.30.12\">ψ 30:12</a> (opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">מָחוֹל</span>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 3:4\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.3.4\">Ec 3:4</a>).","next":"BDB, סָפָה","prev":"BDB, סָפַד"}